1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
After the chaos in the royal capital had finally died down,

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Asta and the Black Bulls were headed back home.

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Look alive, knuckleheads. It's not that much farther now.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
After all the crazy stuff that's happened,

16
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
it feels like we haven't been home in forever.

17
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Yeah, I know.

18
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Maybe I can have at least one day to work out in peace

19
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
before we get another job to do.

20
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
I'm not peaceful to you?

21
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Huh?

22
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Hey, look! Almost there!

23
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:14,000
メステータル

24
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
でも彼がて来るところはずだぜよねだー

25
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,440
そうだね。

26
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:30,480
俺大丈夫もだわない

27
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,960
料理が。

28
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:36,200
初ucchiniが増減奔 ciderか、

29
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,420
直接 hold up

30
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:40,420
Oh

31
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:11,040
We can catch the game

32
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,160
Don't lose

33
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,700
Don't lose

34
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:20,100
Look, don't lose

35
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:21,940
We can catch the game

36
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:23,740
I won't lose

37
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:26,300
I won't lose

38
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:30,180
I won't lose

39
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:31,860
We can catch the game

40
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:44,560
Oh, yeah!

41
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,240
We're finally home!

42
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,000
Hey, Henry!

43
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:50,620
Hurry up and switch this puppy back to the way it was before!

44
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,060
What's the holdup, Henry?

45
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:56,840
Is something wrong?

46
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,200
You gassy?

47
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:02,020
What does the hideout look like?

48
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:04,260
I can't remember

49
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,800
What?

50
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:09,200
This guy's a freaking riot

51
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,640
What the hell?

52
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,680
Didn't you live here longer than anybody?

53
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:14,120
They'll walk you through it

54
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:16,300
First you come in and there's the living room, right?

55
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:18,300
And after that is...

56
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:20,260
You explain it to him, Asta

57
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:21,580
What? Who? Me?

58
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:23,680
No! I'm clueless here!

59
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,720
Next is my shrine to Marie

60
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,020
Actually, I'm pretty sure it was a giant pantry

61
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:29,920
with snacks from all over the kingdom in it

62
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,180
Nah, it was the sauna

63
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:33,820
Whoa, where did you guys live?

64
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:36,380
But maybe we did have a snack cabinet and a sauna

65
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:39,140
To be fair, the rooms were always shifting around

66
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,380
so it's kind of difficult to picture what went where

67
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:43,220
Well...

68
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:46,900
You guys kept breaking everything

69
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:49,540
Thanks for the years of free home repairs

70
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:51,940
but you didn't have to randomly change the whole floor plan

71
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:53,680
Without the help of my spatial magic

72
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:56,340
Captain Yami would have never found his way to the little boy's room

73
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:59,240
Think of all the awkward situations that could have been avoided

74
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,540
Sorry, everyone

75
00:04:01,540 --> 00:04:05,240
Hey! Why don't we tell Henry everything we want in a hideout

76
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,760
and then he can put all of our ideas together

77
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,480
and make this building the coolest, comfiest place in the whole kingdom

78
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:12,000
Yeah, Asta, that's a killer idea

79
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,760
Sounds like a plan to me

80
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:18,340
As long as I can enjoy my drinks in the new place, I'm in

81
00:04:18,340 --> 00:04:19,880
You're shooting for the moon, aren't you?

82
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:23,060
Home is the place where the greatest of friendships are forged

83
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:25,480
Alright, you morons, knock yourselves out

84
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,720
We'll do that, sir!

85
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:28,600
We're counting on you, Henry!

86
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:31,580
Leave it to me

87
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:33,840
Everybody take one

88
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,480
Write all the stuff you want on these forms

89
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,280
Can't forget you two

90
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:41,780
There's always a thing with you

91
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:51,580
Wow

92
00:04:51,580 --> 00:04:53,980
He seems overwhelmed

93
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:56,660
Do you think we maybe asked too much of him?

94
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,380
My request was for the hideout to be relocated

95
00:04:59,380 --> 00:05:01,600
so it's right next to the church where Marie lives

96
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,020
This is great!

97
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,780
Now I can see you every day!

98
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,420
Oh, Marie!

99
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,060
I can't wait to be your neighbor!

100
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:09,540
I am not too picky

101
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:11,740
as long as I get to be in the same room as all my friends

102
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:13,180
every second of every day

103
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:15,560
I've reached the pinnacle of embarrassment

104
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,640
so I want a place where I can hide away forever!

105
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,920
If I can be surrounded by dark curtains

106
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,300
I'll be more than happy, okay?

107
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:23,980
My dream is to live where I'm allowed to eat tenfold

108
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:25,760
Yeah, you already do that

109
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:28,360
Hey, how about we throw in an open bar, too?

110
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,860
I'm surrounded by idiots

111
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:31,960
Hey, guess what?

112
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,360
I requested a room that's right next door to yours, Magna

113
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,620
Which means that if I use my magic detection

114
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:38,080
I'll always be able to tell what you're doing

115
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,260
on the other side of the wall

116
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:40,840
I can't wait to mess with you

117
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,120
I'll knock your teeth out!

118
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:43,460
Go on and try!

119
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,760
Oh, say that again, you little turd!

120
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,360
Only next to me!

121
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:51,280
I guess if Nero gets moved into a different room

122
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,680
then she can't wake me up anymore

123
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:55,800
I was only pecking you so you would stop snoring so loudly

124
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,500
Hey, wait!

125
00:05:56,820 --> 00:05:58,140
When Nero was in her bird form

126
00:05:58,140 --> 00:05:59,960
she used to sleep in the same room as Asta!

127
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,820
I mean, to be fair, he didn't know she was a cute girl back then

128
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,740
She just perched on the windowsill, right?

129
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,500
Why do I even care in the first place?

130
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:09,860
Um...

131
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,900
Henry's really giving this a lot of thought, huh?

132
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,320
Well, it's important!

133
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,000
Alright, get back to work

134
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,740
What's all this stuff for?

135
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:20,040
You want us to go hunting for bugs or something?

136
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,780
Of course not, you idiot

137
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:23,520
My adorable little pets used to live here

138
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:26,020
before our hideout got wrecked by the eye of the midnight sun

139
00:06:26,020 --> 00:06:27,160
so now they're running loose

140
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:30,020
Go track them down before they cause trouble

141
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:31,000
Sir!

142
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,680
Oh, I forgot about them!

143
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:33,960
It's no big deal, though

144
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:36,020
They got pretty used to me after I took care of them

145
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:37,620
I'm sure this is going to be a piece of cake

146
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:39,060
Don't count on that, kid

147
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:39,600
Huh?

148
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:42,040
These woods are their backyard

149
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:45,700
They probably went feral again after a couple of days

150
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:48,940
The second you let your guard down, they'll eat you alive

151
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:50,420
Hang on, if they're that scary

152
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:53,060
how come you're sending me out there with only this tiny net?

153
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:56,400
Quit your panicking and go get my pets back

154
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:59,860
There are three magical beasts

155
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:02,060
If the rest of you are bored, go help them

156
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:02,800
Okay!

157
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,860
Yes, sir! Dummy, sir!

158
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:08,000
It's going to be so much fun to spar with some magical beasts

159
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:11,580
If you lay even one finger on my precious babies, I'll rip you limb from lamb

160
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:13,280
Would you two leave me alone?

161
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,340
I'm trying to have a conversation with a photograph of my little sister

162
00:07:16,340 --> 00:07:17,940
Our friends counting on us

163
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:19,980
I hope this won't end in total embarrassment

164
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:21,720
Are you listening to me?

165
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,420
You guys ready to go?

166
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:26,540
I think the three of us should team up since we're the squad rookies

167
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:28,400
If you say so

168
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:32,200
Wait, wasn't Zora here just a second ago?

169
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,020
No thanks

170
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,740
I've got better things to do

171
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:38,160
Oh well

172
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,500
That mask-wearing punk can bail if he wants

173
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:41,700
I'll just punish him later

174
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:45,160
I've got an important duty to attend to

175
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,720
Well, I'm leaving this up to you guys

176
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:56,420
Hey monsters!

177
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,400
Where are you?

178
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,380
That's actually kind of cute

179
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:06,240
Cute!

180
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,640
Do you really think that's going to work?

181
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:10,040
How stupid can you be?

182
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:11,980
Don't forget

183
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:13,700
The captain said they're probably feral

184
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:15,660
So if we act like bait, we'll just get mauled

185
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:17,840
I know, but I was the one who took care of them

186
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,780
So maybe they'll come to their senses when they realize who I am

187
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:21,840
Come to think of it, Nero

188
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,220
You were kind of like my pet back when you were in your bird form

189
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:25,820
So you understand what I mean, don't you?

190
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,520
You shouldn't patronize me

191
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:31,220
In my bird form, I was watching over your grimoire, not you

192
00:08:31,220 --> 00:08:33,720
If you ask me, you were the pet

193
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:37,800
They say the more you argue, the closer you are

194
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:40,120
I mean, not that it makes any difference to me

195
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,760
I only came along because I have no choice in the matter

196
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,900
What's that key I'm sensing?

197
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:45,420
What?

198
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:48,960
Um, I don't know, but there was no way I was thinking about you two

199
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,700
Found ya!

200
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:50,160
Pasta!

201
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:55,160
What's this flock of antsy birds doing here?

202
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,680
They're about to pick me to dance!

203
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:59,160
They must be angry because you're so noisy

204
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:03,620
I'll see if I can locate them from the sky

205
00:09:03,620 --> 00:09:05,220
Nero, save me!

206
00:09:06,100 --> 00:09:07,620
Maybe I'm worried about nothing

207
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,540
Kind of seems like they hate each other

208
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:12,260
Wait, we're alone now?

209
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,460
Man, this place is freaking creepy

210
00:09:15,460 --> 00:09:18,160
What's the matter? You scared?

211
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,800
What are you talking about? I'm not scared

212
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,760
Just shut your yap and put some pep in your step

213
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,640
Hey, I told you to hurry

214
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:30,460
That little snot probably hit somewhere so we could go

215
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:30,800
BOOM!

216
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,320
And try to spook me

217
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:34,560
Don't bother, Small Fry

218
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,360
I'll make you regret this

219
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:45,080
Did you think an amateur move like that would actually work on me?

220
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,580
No!

221
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:46,080
Aaaaaah!

222
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,080
Aaaaaah!

223
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,080
Aaaaaah!

224
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:48,580
Aaaaaah!

225
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:49,080
Aaaaaah!

226
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,580
Aaaaaah!

227
00:09:49,580 --> 00:09:50,080
Aaaaaah!

228
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,580
Aaaaaah!

229
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:52,580
My spear and shock plan was a huge success!

230
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:53,580
Aaaaaah!

231
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:54,080
Aaaaaah!

232
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,080
I'ma kill you!

233
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:55,580
I don't know!

234
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:56,580
Are you sure you can?

235
00:09:56,580 --> 00:10:01,560
Well, there's nobody out here to make us stop fighting so feel free to come at me with everything you got!

236
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:07,560
Well, I wouldn't say that if I were you! Things have changed and you and I are on totally different levels these days!

237
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:14,560
That's for damn sure! You may not know this, but I developed unbelievable strength after our battle when you were possessed!

238
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:18,560
Oh really? That makes two of us then!

239
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:25,560
The mana's calling to me! I haven't sparred with you in ages! So I'll probably have too much fun and get carried away!

240
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,560
What are you waiting for?

241
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:31,560
Oh gosh! What was that loud sound?

242
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:36,560
Magna and Luck, I think they're reigniting their fiery friendship.

243
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,560
Who gives a crap?

244
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:40,560
And you two! How long do you plan on cowering behind me?

245
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:44,560
Please pretend I'm not here! This whole situation is so humiliating!

246
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:46,560
Then why didn't you just stay home?

247
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:49,560
Well, I wanted to, but there aren't any walls left to conceal my shame!

248
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,560
I'm not your damn wall!

249
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:55,560
This forest is really scary, and we're not sure when the magical beasts might attack.

250
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:58,560
Don't worry, your face is the most terrifying thing here!

251
00:10:58,560 --> 00:10:59,560
Hey!

252
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:02,560
I wish you'd stop making eye contact with me!

253
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:11,560
Yep, there they are. The faster I wrangle these monsters, the sooner I can visit my sweet Marie.

254
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,560
You ready guys?

255
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:17,560
Hey, what the hell are you doing?!

256
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:22,560
I'm sorry, it's just that they popped up out of nowhere and it caused my embarrassment to evolve into pure terror!

257
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:25,560
But I can't do this. My heart's not ready to let me go.

258
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,560
Get off of me!

259
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:29,560
I can't believe I got teamed up with the two biggest scaredy-cats on the squad!

260
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:32,560
How am I supposed to catch these things with you two hanging on to me?!

261
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:47,560
Yum, this is so delicious! Nothing's better than snuffing down and be fun while you're hunting magical beasts!

262
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:50,560
I prefer a strong drink.

263
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:54,560
Hey, Finral, can you make a portal and go buy me another bottle or two?

264
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:57,560
Um, don't you guys think we should get back to hunting soon?

265
00:11:57,560 --> 00:12:01,560
Oh, quit being a goody two-shoes and drink up, you big nerd!

266
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:05,560
You know you want to try some of these nummy treats, they're fresh out of the oven!

267
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:09,560
Listen, it's not that I don't want to, I just don't feel like it's a good idea!

268
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:12,560
If the captain found out, he'd kill me for sure!

269
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:18,560
Then again, I'm sure the others already caught them anyway, so there's no reason we can't relax for a little bit!

270
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:20,560
Hey, where'd Finral go?

271
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,560
So get me that drink!

272
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:25,560
By the way, do you have any more snacks, Charmy?

273
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:30,560
Have I had too many?

274
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:35,560
Oh my goodness, Charmy, you're so tall all of a sudden and so hairy too!

275
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:39,560
Not to mention those nails of yours, you're in desperate need of a manicure, you know?

276
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:44,560
Otherwise, that pretty boy from the Golden Dawn will never like you back!

277
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:50,560
That was a great fight! You've really improved!

278
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:56,560
Heh, back at ya. Just for now, I guess I can let you off the hook.

279
00:12:56,560 --> 00:13:00,560
That said, you're not gonna leave me behind, do you understand me?

280
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:09,560
If you get ten times stronger than I will too. You might get a step ahead, but you'll never outdo me. I hope you're okay with that.

281
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:14,560
My bad! Sorry, I couldn't really hear your big speech over all the growling.

282
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:21,560
Aw, dammit, there's always something! Just give me a second to recover my mana and stamina and then I'll save you, I promise.

283
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,560
Okay, that sounds fair.

284
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:30,560
Hey, don't eat me! I'm the guy who used to take care of you before Austin came along! Don't tell me you forgot about me already! Come on, I swear I don't take that gun!

285
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:35,560
Geez, where could those things be?

286
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:39,560
Nero still hasn't come back either.

287
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:42,560
Being alone with him makes me jumpy.

288
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,560
Those are Magnus glasses!

289
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,560
It can't be! They ate him?

290
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:59,560
Look!

291
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,560
Oh man, are you guys okay?

292
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:02,560
Talk to us!

293
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:10,560
It's bad. The other Black Bulls were also defeated by the Magical Beasts.

294
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:11,560
Huh?

295
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:15,560
Asta, forget about us. Just run!

296
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:18,560
Captain Yomi! He's in trouble!

297
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,560
It's occupied.

298
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,560
Hey!

299
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,560
I'm in here, dammit!

300
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,560
Who is that?

301
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:32,560
Look, if you're good for nothing slackers are back already, then you better have my pets with you.

302
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:36,560
I'm up against a tough opponent here and if I don't concentrate he's gonna go back and hide each other.

303
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,560
Give me a minute!

304
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,560
Sheesh!

305
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:49,560
I'm glad the three of you are home, but you're probably not waiting in line to use the John, huh?

306
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:55,560
Captain Yomi's way stronger than we are, so he might be okay.

307
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,560
But Magna and Luck almost got eaten alive.

308
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:01,560
If all three attack him at once, I'm not sure if he'll make it.

309
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,560
Just hang in there, okay?

310
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:06,560
I'm on my way to rescue you!

311
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:07,560
Hey!

312
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:09,560
Stop licking me already, you big lugs!

313
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:10,560
Ugh!

314
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:12,560
Your drool smells like garbage!

315
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:15,560
What the heck, Captain Yomi?

316
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:19,560
I rushed over here to save you because I thought you were being attacked by the Magical Beast, but you're fine!

317
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:22,560
Well, I guess they technically did attack me.

318
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:27,560
They wanted some attention from you.

319
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:28,560
Come on, that's it?

320
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:29,560
Really?

321
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:31,560
These big fellas are always crazy affectionate.

322
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:34,560
In fact, they've been like that ever since I first met them.

323
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:37,560
I remember, I was on my way back to the hideout.

324
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:47,560
When I found them, the poor thing's parents had just been killed and they were all alone.

325
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:52,560
I guess some nobles were out hunting magical beasts for support.

326
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:54,560
Sorry, little ones.

327
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:57,560
You folks aren't ever gonna wake up again.

328
00:15:57,560 --> 00:16:02,560
Look, I got separated from my parents too, but all we can do is chin up and keep on keeping on.

329
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,560
Hey, don't get the wrong idea.

330
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:07,560
I never said I was gonna take care of you.

331
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:12,560
How am I supposed to say no to that?

332
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:15,560
Oh, wow!

333
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:18,560
That was such a heartwarming story, sir!

334
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:22,560
I bet those beasts were so adorable and they were teeny weeny little babies!

335
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,560
How sweet.

336
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:29,560
Anyway, it didn't even take six months for these guys to grow up as big as their parents had been.

337
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:33,560
It cost me a fortune to keep them fed, so I keep trying to abandon them.

338
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:35,560
Okay, you just ruined it!

339
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,560
That's mean.

340
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:42,560
I sent you guys off to Catrum so they didn't wander into a nearby village and wreak havoc or anything like that.

341
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:45,560
Although, if it seemed like they wanted to return to the wild and be free,

342
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:49,560
I was kind of thinking of letting them loose in the mountains somewhere as soon as we could get a hold of them again.

343
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:51,560
Whee!

344
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:53,560
Hey, Captain Yami's still in one piece!

345
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,560
Magna, you're back!

346
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:57,560
I thought you were hurt real bad!

347
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:58,560
Nope.

348
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,560
But they did lick us all over, so we smell kinda ripe now.

349
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:06,560
It seemed like they were gonna gobble us up, but they just wanted us to pet them and play with them.

350
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:09,560
Apparently, it was enough to make everyone faint from exhaustion.

351
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:11,560
You're such a troublesome group.

352
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:18,560
Well, we figured if they were that excited to see us, then Captain Yami would have a really hard time fighting them off, so we were concerned for his safety!

353
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:21,560
But the boss man's A-OK!

354
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,560
I'm sure he's used to it. He is their owner, after all.

355
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:27,560
Who's a good magical beastie?

356
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:30,560
I better make some dolls of the three of you as well.

357
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,560
Don't lick Marie or you're dead.

358
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:34,560
They're pretty cute, but their drool smells like death.

359
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:38,560
If you want us to pet you some more, go take a bath and brush your teeth.

360
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:43,560
I see. They must love the rest of the Black Bulls just like they love the Captain!

361
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:47,560
Hey there! Since I'm your caretaker, do you want me to pet you for a while?

362
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:52,560
Judging by that look, they still think of you as dinner.

363
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:56,560
That can't be it! These guys totally adore me!

364
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:59,560
Here you go! I brought you a little snacky snack, but you gotta sit first!

365
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:02,560
This is hard to watch.

366
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:05,560
Hey, did I miss anything?

367
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:08,560
Zora! What have you been up to this whole time?

368
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:14,560
I don't see how that's your business, kid. The hideout's still not finished. The sun's going down.

369
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:21,560
Actually, it is. I just need to put it together.

370
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:27,560
Recombination magic. Black Bull's hideout. Hard Rock Bison style.

371
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:39,560
The outside was Magna's idea. So tacky.

372
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:43,560
You know, for a royal, you really don't know sophistication in class when you see them.

373
00:18:43,560 --> 00:18:46,560
Sweet! I can't wait to look inside!

374
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:50,560
Oh, it's just what I wanted. This way I can drink to my heart's content.

375
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:55,560
I keep stuffing my face and the food never stops coming!

376
00:18:55,560 --> 00:19:00,560
Why is there a giant hole in the floor?

377
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:05,560
I wanted a place where I could hide in the dark when I'm embarrassed, which is constantly...

378
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:08,560
I couldn't be Marie's neighbor, but this is still nice.

379
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:12,560
Hey, Angel Marie, tell Big Brother tomorrow's forecast, huh?

380
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:18,560
Mostly sunny, but partly cloudy. Temperatures will be mild during the day and a little chillier as night falls.

381
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:25,560
This talking Marie doll is incredible. Henry is a genius.

382
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:28,560
No cute maid, huh? Oh well.

383
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:31,560
I can clean your room for you.

384
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:33,560
No thanks!

385
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,560
Just an idea.

386
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:38,560
Uh, right. I appreciate the thought.

387
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:41,560
What about the rooms? Who's everyone paired up with?

388
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:48,560
I'm glad you asked. This part was Gordon's request.

389
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,560
We should all share the same room as friends.

390
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:59,560
What? So I'm not next door to Asta, I'm sharing a room with him? As friends? That's a step above friends, isn't it? This is crazy!

391
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:03,560
Kinda reminds me of sharing a space with Yuno and Nash at the church.

392
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:06,560
Man, this is gonna be a blast!

393
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:08,560
I'm not okay with this.

394
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,560
Neither am I.

395
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:12,560
Right, this isn't up to my royal standards.

396
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:14,560
So simple!

397
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:21,560
Well, I can't say I'm crazy about sharing a room with luck, but it'll be fun to stay up late chatting with Captain Yami every night.

398
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:23,560
Yeah, I'm gonna veto that right now.

399
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:31,560
Alright, I forgot. The captain's in a different room.

400
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:33,560
Seriously?

401
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,560
What the hell is this?

402
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:40,560
It was a request from the magic beasts.

403
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:44,560
Well, when you put it like that, I guess...

404
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:47,560
It's still a no!

405
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:52,560
That's better. We need a hideout.

406
00:20:52,560 --> 00:20:55,560
We need a hideout, not a freaking amusement park.

407
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:59,560
That's why I made Henry change it back into the dusty old mansion it was when we started.

408
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:02,560
The wine fountain was nice, but it's a lot cozier this way.

409
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:05,560
Yeah, it's got that home sweet home feeling.

410
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:09,560
I'm definitely not disappointed at all. No way!

411
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:15,560
When I first walked into this hideout after becoming a black bull,

412
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:20,560
everyone accepted me right off the bat even though I didn't have any magic ability.

413
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:23,560
Ever since then, every day's been an adventure.

414
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:29,560
We had plenty of close calls, but it always turned out okay because they were here to help me.

415
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:32,560
You guys! There's something I need to say!

416
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:35,560
I'm really glad I joined the black bulls and met all of you!

417
00:21:35,560 --> 00:21:38,560
Aw, what's making you get so sentimental all of a sudden?

418
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:40,560
I feel the same.

419
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:44,560
All of us have grown so much because you never gave up, Asta.

420
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:49,560
You're reckless and stubborn, but that's not a bad thing. Sometimes.

421
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:51,560
We need to hurry and clear Asta's name!

422
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:52,560
Yeah!

423
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:57,560
First things first, we better figure out everything we can about those devils.

424
00:21:57,560 --> 00:22:00,560
Right!

